scene page
say strong | Canberra.
say | Sydney and Melbourne both wanted to be the capital, so neither got it. In 1908 a site between them was chosen, and a city was designed and built for the job.
say | The plan came from an international competition, won by the American architects Walter and Marion Griffin.
say aside | Melbourne stood in until Parliament moved to Canberra in 1927.
